{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_04db88fb63a2efe1ef38ef689517acf615396ebce448d789cec943d943850f39"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented usage workflow: start the API with uvicorn on port 8000, run python agent.py in a second terminal, then issue Plan/Generate/Run/Feedback commands."},{"claim_ids":["clm_07e1c93d49d31ce6288d8e82d222bed09a892e7b2b2d9fc8217b37808565b401"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Generated tests target TEST_API_URL if set, otherwise defaulting to http://localhost:8000."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0ec4f1864ea1df81abc4350f7db662fba130a7c1bfec7893dcffd8327d81d84a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"By default the agent assumes the target API has specific REST routes like /api/endpoint, but users can customize this via prompts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1e85ccd13fce97bd1a1bf72dd5d76ea778cabcec5ea42a7ae8b01c94f646ae4d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README's example install lists fastapi, uvicorn, requests, pytest, langchain, and openai as pip dependencies, and requires an OpenRouter API key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_55e8736a2fb6f34fd32cb93f9ce01a2bc4215fc526cb95629c9015fcd287e12c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Troubleshooting guidance covers missing OPENROUTER_API_KEY, unexpected 401 responses needing an Authorization header, and mismatched generated routes, suggesting explicit prompts or feedback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6b70563049e3fd3bbd9ac81b3757869ecb3dc00b4105630f289cb0d4e15f5477"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"api_tester.py exposes a command-line interface with subcommands plan, generate, run, and feedback, usable directly without the chat agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_79b2770a077d8ef0ec6678dcc1dad579d5c5c8a8f7f403dfaac97f04dbb58a0c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"agent.py is a LangChain chatbot whose actions (Plan, Generate, Run, Feedback) invoke tools in agent_tools.py, which run api_tester.py commands in subprocesses."},{"claim_ids":["clm_82abb1410525838df3370e0fc34fba9bc7b342aa9c55cbc5af4bdfd9281dbf1b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project comprises main.py (a sample FastAPI app), api_tester.py (CLI logic for plan/generate/run/feedback), agent_tools.py, agent.py, and generated_tests.py."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9896ac42d13832ca47b3f02b068423d4bed36ab030c8a6514b454a41493ee773"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Generated test quality appears heavily dependent on user prompting; the README notes LLM output quality depends heavily on how it is prompted and may invent routes not present in the real API."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ac2acb17d2057bccb2fb785b33b632d3b18a8513d532d502e94f29cb2a3a0cee"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Running python agent.py starts an interactive prompt where the user types commands or instructions, with 'quit' or 'exit' to stop."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d3dc4b18bbf3f1aca95d741cb9625569498d2e8887fcbec0ea5005f19e9b1c98"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prompting guidance advises explicitly describing endpoints, specifying desired test names and structure, and providing example test-code skeletons to steer output."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f7a986a587365d9051db61fe4529228e363262057fb45cbb633d4ea973b8b220"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README suggests setting temperature to 0.0 in api_tester.py to reduce randomness and obtain more deterministic LLM output."}],"claim_ids":["clm_04db88fb63a2efe1ef38ef689517acf615396ebce448d789cec943d943850f39","clm_07e1c93d49d31ce6288d8e82d222bed09a892e7b2b2d9fc8217b37808565b401","clm_0ec4f1864ea1df81abc4350f7db662fba130a7c1bfec7893dcffd8327d81d84a","clm_1e85ccd13fce97bd1a1bf72dd5d76ea778cabcec5ea42a7ae8b01c94f646ae4d","clm_55e8736a2fb6f34fd32cb93f9ce01a2bc4215fc526cb95629c9015fcd287e12c","clm_6b70563049e3fd3bbd9ac81b3757869ecb3dc00b4105630f289cb0d4e15f5477","clm_79b2770a077d8ef0ec6678dcc1dad579d5c5c8a8f7f403dfaac97f04dbb58a0c","clm_82abb1410525838df3370e0fc34fba9bc7b342aa9c55cbc5af4bdfd9281dbf1b","clm_9896ac42d13832ca47b3f02b068423d4bed36ab030c8a6514b454a41493ee773","clm_ac2acb17d2057bccb2fb785b33b632d3b18a8513d532d502e94f29cb2a